    <string name="perm_dnd_channel_why">The warning can\'t show during Do Not Disturb yet. Android only lets you turn this on yourself, in the notification settings.</string>
    <string name="perm_dnd_channel_steps">On the next screen, turn on “Override Do Not Disturb” (on some phones it\'s called “Ignore Do Not Disturb”), then come back.</string>
